      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COONDLE (2) finished second two runs back at Broome then improved last time out to score by a neck over 1300m there. Racing consistently and likely to be in the finish again. ESQUEL (3) finished out of the money two starts back then was beaten 14 lengths when seventh over 1300m at Broome a week-and-a-half ago. Suitably placed so anticipating a better run this time. CLOSE TALKER (1) has been in the market at her last couple of runs but failed to threaten, the latest effort a modest eighth at Broome over 1300m. Where there's smoke there's fire and rates a top-three chance on best figures. LA SIGNORA DANE (4) was in the money two starts back at Port Hedland but couldn't back it up last time when seventh, beaten 9 lengths, at Broome over 1300m. Has her share of ability and can do a lot better.",
